{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Svectiv8xYPt6KFZ3c1Xsw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:12.009258+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Svectiv8xYPt6KFZ3c1Xsw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/0DyDnBX9YUZdtXumqpVO1BFQ7XhXibDo8PCjgjdibAchm2s6V2EUf0MiaAplWKwlyEuo2FWdKctI41VYjvoGh2Lwr06KN7SwvDSgiahylVcpQlg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>1</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>学院师资力量和优势学科方向</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>力学与土木工程学院具有百余年办学历史，学院由</span></span><span><strong><span>5</span></strong></span><span><span> 个系（工程力学系、岩土与矿建工程系、建筑学系、建筑工程系、城市地下空间工程系）和</span></span><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><span> 个实验中心（工程力学、土木工程）组成。学院拥有</span></span><span><strong><span>岩石力学与分形研究所、岩土力学研究中心、爆破工程研究中心、现代爆破技术应用研究所、防灾工程研究所、建筑设计与人居环境研究中心、采矿岩石力学国际创新中心</span></strong></span><span><span>等科研机构，支撑了煤炭精细勘探与智能开发、隧道工程灾变防控与智能建养</span></span><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><span>个全国重点实验室。学院拥有</span></span><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><span>个国家重点学科（岩土工程、工程力学）；</span></span><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><span>个北京市重点学科（土木工程、力学），</span></span><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><span>个教育部“长江学者奖励计划”特聘教授设岗学科（工程力学、岩土工程），</span></span><span><strong><span>1</span></strong></span><span><span>个北京市级实验教学示范中心（工程力学），</span></span><span><strong><span>3</span></strong></span><span><span>个博士点、</span></span><span><strong><span>6</span></strong></span><span><span>个硕士点，平均每年招收研究生</span></span><span><strong><span>400</span></strong></span><span><span>人左右。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院拥有雄厚的师资力量，现有教师</span></span><span><strong><span>120</span></strong></span><span><span>余人，其中中国工程院院士</span></span><span><strong><span>1</span></strong></span><span><span>人，中国科学院院士</span></span><span><strong><span>1</span></strong></span><span><span>人，双聘院士</span></span><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><span>人；教授</span></span><span><strong><span>51</span></strong></span><span><span>人，副教授/高工</span></span><span><strong><span>42</span></strong></span><span><span>人；国家</span></span><span><strong><span>973</span></strong></span><span><span>项目首席科学家</span></span><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><span>人、国家重点研发计划首席科学家</span></span><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><span>人，国家自然科学基金杰出青年科学基金获得者</span></span><span><strong><span>4</span></strong></span><span><span>人，国家“万人计划”科技创新领军人才</span></span><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><span>人，长江学者</span></span><span><strong><span>3</span></strong></span><span><span>人，优秀青年科学基金、青年长江学者、“万人计划”青年拔尖人才</span></span><span><strong><span>8</span></strong></span><span><span>人，青年人才托举工程</span></span><span><strong><span>4</span></strong></span><span><span>人，享受政府特殊津贴专家</span></span><span><strong><span>9</span></strong></span><span><span> 人，教育部跨世纪／新世纪优秀人才支持计划</span></span><span><strong><span>13</span></strong></span><span><span>人，教育部创新团队</span></span><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><span>个，国家级“万人计划”教学名师</span></span><span><strong><span>1</span></strong></span><span><span>人、北京市教学名师和青年教学名师</span></span><span><strong><span>7</span></strong></span><span><span>人，北京市卓越青年科学家</span></span><span><strong><span>1</span></strong></span><span><span>人，首都劳动奖章获得者</span></span><span><strong><span>1</span></strong></span><span><span>人等。全国百篇优秀博士学位论文</span></span><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><span>篇、北京市优秀博士论文</span></span><span><strong><span>1</span></strong></span><span><span>篇，北京市优秀博士学位论文提名奖</span></span><span><strong><span>1</span></strong></span><span><span>篇。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院着眼于国家工程建设的重大需求，重视基础研究、应用研究和跨学科交叉融合，不断提升科研创新能力，鼓励创新思维，形成了优势特色学科研究方向，取得了一大批高水平科技成果。目前学院的主要研究方向：采矿岩石力学基础理论、煤炭开采变革性新工法、井巷快速掘进理论与技术、智能建造与固废材料利用等，部分标志性成果如下图所示。近年来，学院承担国家重点研发计划项目、国家自然科学基金重点项目、国家自然科学基金面上项目、北京市自然科学基金项目等纵向和横向课题近</span></span><span><strong><span>1000</span></strong></span><span><span>项，学院获授权国家发明专利、实用新型专利各</span></span><span><strong><span>400</span></strong></span><span><span>余项，获国家发明专利金奖</span></span><span><strong><span>1</span></strong></span><span><span>件，出版学术专著</span></span><span><strong><span>30</span></strong></span><span><span>余部，发表学术论文</span></span><span><strong><span>2000</span></strong></span><span><span>余篇，其中SCI、El 检索</span></span><span><strong><span>1000</span></strong></span><span><span>余篇。学院的研究成果先后荣获国家技术发明一等奖</span></span><span><strong><span>1</span></strong></span><span><span>项、二等奖</span></span><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><span>项，国家自然科学二等奖</span></span><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><span>项，国家科学技术进步二等奖</span></span><span><strong><span>10</span></strong></span><span><span>项；省部级和社会力量科技奖</span></span><span><strong><span>200</span></strong></span><span><span>余项。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/0DyDnBX9YUZECP9qkFyX4TVaeiaaRCIkqKzNHKtvsvFPHaw8yzaErIzicYCsqfn6VLfKAchugqaXs1L0Zs5WhEUDOrSl9SpwC4dJweT6DUnP0/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></td><td><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/0DyDnBX9YUYDLNDzcza0BUG9NvmIibxOXIoZbLJlWXO4rVZibZ4AYkhGWdbnPCesea39MHn8iaicgEvH2noiaU62iaofPpWmz1CLB8WoCDaL8xlmI/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/0DyDnBX9YUZUN0QfxZl0kC3Pz3lOoHFibfR41V7IsQicAZUaVjzNb61KN1kANJRqklX68SM8OEibmcMPM5YZrBxhKgJaeVbpwugN1vTsHYC7fQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></td><td><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/0DyDnBX9YUZFjLp0eMf1ywwD8z1HQibrJLTsfM6gQwS1ub37AOaFB1BrQ22et0GwwicMJsnLnGB4bHNDu1dAUtFKbaMrboXYT3GAfUj6pT1Rg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/0DyDnBX9YUbxD6GlUiad1nMq1k9eVwb7YSz8N0AG2Ls9wMpJ1OwF4kPY3icuw2lnVUxZiblef99DrB86JaI0M4KPhaUP34pZ3LGBbRUNZGSHtE/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></td><td><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/0DyDnBX9YUZOicwhuEB2wUSEiaBBMUXrTVZj3LdAhGgH7nNqqHOSo0lgzr1tG6TueZmQC67PDyt7cVckoFC4b0pmLw47anFsE2beBWfQDEphE/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></td></tr></tbody></table><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 学院取得的一些标志性成果</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>为加大拔尖创新人才选拔力度，根据教育部有关推免生工作管理办法，结合学院实际情况，2027年力学与土木工程学院拟</span></span><span><strong><span>大量接收推荐免试研究生</span></strong></span><span><span>，推免生录取后第一年发放一等学业奖学金，并将对其中优秀生源给予奖励。</span></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>02</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.2027届普通</span></span><span><strong><span>全日制本科毕业生</span></strong></span><span><span>，有望取得本科所在院校的推荐免试生资格；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检要求；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.符合招生学院规定的其他申请条件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.2027年入学前获得本科毕业证书及学士学位证书。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>03</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>接收类别、专业与人数</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 硕士推免生：我院仅接收学习方式为全日制的推免生，大量接收，但不超各专业招生计划数量的</span></span><span><strong><span>50%</span></strong></span><span><span>，各招生专业均可接收推免生，具体招生专业及人数情况为：土木工程（学硕</span></span><span><strong><span>25</span></strong></span><span><span>人、全日制专硕</span></span><span><strong><span>71</span></strong></span><span><span>人）、力学（</span></span><span><strong><span>27</span></strong></span><span><span>人）、城乡规划学（</span></span><span><strong><span>3</span></strong></span><span><span>人）、建筑学（</span></span><span><strong><span>10</span></strong></span><span><span>人）、能源建设工程（</span></span><span><strong><span>5</span></strong></span><span><span>人）。</span></span></p><p><span><span> 2. 直博生：可接收专业为：力学、土木工程、能源建设工程、工程管理，</span></span><span><strong><span>4</span></strong></span><span><span>个专业计划招生人数</span></span><span><strong><span>15</span></strong></span><span><span>人。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>04</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>申请与选拔考核程序</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>根据教育部办公厅</span></span><span><strong><span>《关于进一步完善推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生工作办法的通知》</span></strong></span><span><span>（教学厅[2014]5号）的有关精神， 2027年我院接收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生的基本程序如下：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.考生登录“中国矿业大学（北京）推免生预报名系统“</span></span><span><strong><span>（yjsglxt.cumtb.edu.cn/open/RecruitTkssTmYbm/signin.aspx）</span></strong></span><span><span>注册报名，报名系统开放时间为</span></span><span><strong><span>（2026年9月1日至9月14日）</span></strong></span><span><span>，学院查看信息后，组织复试工作，复试以网络视频复试为主。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.考生参加</span></span><span><strong><span>复试</span></strong></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>考生在复试时需核验以下书面材料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>(1) 查验第二代身份证、学生证原件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(2) 历年在校学习成绩单原件，并加盖推荐高校教务处公章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(3) 其他有关材料（如大学英语四、六级考试成绩单复印件，其他获奖证书、本人代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等）复印件。</span></span></p><p><span><span>(4) 考生在接到我院复试通知后须在网上缴纳复试费</span></span><span><strong><span>100元</span></strong></span><span><span>，在“矿大北京研究生”公众号的“研招专栏”中进行缴费，详见我校研究生网站《2027年接收推荐免试研究生工作安排》中的流程。</span></span></p><p><span><span>(5) 正式入学报到后，参加我校校医院组织的</span></span><span><strong><span>体检</span></strong></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 考生填报专业志愿。</span></span></p><p><span><span>获得正式推免生资格的应届本科毕业生确定拟申请的专业后，在中国研究生招生信息网（以下简称研招网）的</span></span><span><strong><span>”推免服务系统“（网址：http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）</span></strong></span><span><span>开通后填报专业志愿（预计为</span></span><span><strong><span>2026年9月21日</span></strong></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.  办理拟录取手续。</span></span></p><p><span><span>  学院向复试合格者发出待录取通知，待录取者在研招网“推免服务系统”按要求及时接受待录取通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5. 上报学校研招办进行审核，并在我校研究生招生网上</span></span><span><strong><span>（https://yz.cumtb.edu.cn/）公示7日。</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>05</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>学费与奖助学金</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（一）学费及学制</span></span></p><p><span><span> 根据国家政策，凡被我校正式录取的以全日制方式学习的硕士研究生学费标准为</span></span><span><strong><span>8000</span></strong></span><span><span>元/年，学制为</span></span><span><strong><span>三</span></strong></span><span><span>年，直博生学费标准为</span></span><span><strong><span>10000</span></strong></span><span><span>/年，学制为</span></span><span><strong><span>五</span></strong></span><span><span>年。 </span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）奖助学金</span></span></p><p><span><span>学校奖助体系包括国家奖学金、国家助学金、学业奖学金等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>1. 硕士研究生</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）国家奖学金：</span></span><span><strong><span>20000</span></strong></span><span><span>元，按国家及学校文件评选。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）国家助学金：</span></span></p><p><span><span>金额：</span></span><span><strong><span>600/月*10个月。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>（3）学业奖学金：</span></span></p><p><span><span> 金额：</span></span></p><p><span><span> 一年级：</span></span><span><strong><span>10000元/年，一次发放</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span> 二、三年级：</span></span></p><p><span><span>一等学业奖学金占</span></span><span><strong><span>30%，10000元</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>二等学业奖学金占</span></span><span><strong><span>50%，8000元</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>三等学业奖学金占</span></span><span><strong><span>20%，6000元</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>2. 直博生</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）国家奖学金：</span></span><span><strong><span>30000</span></strong></span><span><span>元，按国家及学校文件评选。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）国家助学金：</span></span></p><p><span><span>金额：</span></span><span><strong><span>1500元/月*10个月</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>（3）学业奖学金：</span></span></p><p><span><span>第一学年：</span></span></p><p><span><span>一等学业奖学金，</span></span><span><strong><span>18000元</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>第二学年至第五学年：</span></span></p><p><span><span>一等学业奖学金占</span></span><span><strong><span>20%，18000元</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>二等学业奖学金占</span></span><span><strong><span>40%，15000元</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>三等学业奖学金占</span></span><span><strong><span>40%，12000元</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>06</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 申请人必须保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性。学校将在复试结束后对拟录取的推免生名单进行公示，</span></span><span><strong><span>若申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，我院不予录取。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>2. 学院确定接收的推免生，在入学报到时未获得本科毕业证书者，将取消其录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 已被接收的推荐免试生无须再参加全国硕士研究生招生考试。否则，将取消推免生资格，列为统考生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 直博生在学期间不能申请自费出国留学，可参加国家高水平大学公派出国留学计划申请出国留学；凡中期考核不合格或个人原因退出学业者，按结（肄）业处理，学校不负责其就业事宜。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5. 咨询、监督与申诉渠道</span></span></p><p><span><span>中国矿业大学（北京）研招办</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：</span></span><span><strong><span>010-62331208</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><span><strong><span>yzb@cumtb.edu.cn</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>中国矿业大学（北京）纪委</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：</span></span><span><span>010-62331416</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><span><span>jjsc@cumtb.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>6. 如有问题，可通过电话和邮件与我院研究生教学管理办公室联系咨询。</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>010-62339131</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><span><span>ljxyyjs@126.com</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>往期精彩回顾</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_g